// Black Dragon Disciple: the Draconic Transformations

// Transformations (name, description)
@1 = ~Claw & Bite~
@2 = ~Claw & Bite
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Black claws grow on both hands of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains two claw attacks dealing 1d4 slashing damage each, with no two-weapon penalty. The claws are +1 magical weapons (to hit and damage), +2 at level 10, +3 at level 15, +4 at level 20 and +5 at level 25.

Each successful attack has a 20% chance to provoke a bite, dealing 1d6 piercing and 1d4 acid damage.

He gains the innate abilities Extend Claws and Retract Claws to summon or dismiss them at will. The claws take the magical weapon slot and the shield slot; after a level-up, extend them again to get the claws of the new level.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@3 = ~Dragon Scale~
@4 = ~Dragon Scale
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Black scales cover the skin of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains a permanent +3 bonus to Armor Class, +4 at level 10 and +5 at level 15.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@5 = ~Draconic Resilience~
@6 = ~Draconic Resilience
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The body of the Black Dragon Disciple hardens like a dragon's. He gains +2 Constitution, +4 from level 15, and immunity to critical hits. The resilient skull takes the helmet slot.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@7 = ~Swamp Stride~
@8 = ~Swamp Stride
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 3
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple moves through swamps and their poisons like a black dragon. He becomes immune to poison, and to Grease, Entangle, Web, Stinking Cloud and Spike Growth.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@9 = ~Blindsense~
@10 = ~Blindsense
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 6
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple perceives his surroundings without relying on sight. He becomes immune to blindness, can see and attack invisible enemies, and his vision range slightly increases.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@11 = ~Dragon Wings~
@12 = ~Dragon Wings
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 7
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

Leathery wings tear through the back of the Black Dragon Disciple. He gains +4 movement speed and the innate ability Wing Buffet, usable at will and recharging in 4 rounds.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~
@13 = ~Dragon Apotheosis~
@14 = ~Dragon Apotheosis
(Draconic Transformation)

Level: 9
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1

The Black Dragon Disciple becomes one with the dragon within. He gains +2 Constitution, +2 Strength, +2 Charisma and +4 Armor Class.

This draconic transformation takes effect as soon as it is learned: its effects are permanent, persist through death and cannot be dispelled. It then stays in the spellbook as a reminder; it cannot be cast.~

// Claw & Bite: claws, Extend / Retract Claws, bite
@20 = ~Draconic Claws~
@21 = ~Draconic Claws

The black claws of the Black Dragon Disciple. Each successful attack has a 20% chance to provoke a bite, dealing 1d6 piercing and 1d4 acid damage.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 1d4 (slashing)
No two-weapon penalty~
@22 = ~Extend Claws~
@23 = ~Extend Claws

The Black Dragon Disciple extends his claws: they take the magical weapon slot and the shield slot, with the strength of his current level. They can be retracted at will.~
@24 = ~Retract Claws~
@25 = ~Retract Claws

The Black Dragon Disciple retracts his claws and frees his hands. They can be extended again at will.~
@26 = ~Draconic Bite~

// Draconic Resilience: the skull
@30 = ~Draconic Skull~
@31 = ~Draconic Skull

The hardened skull of the Black Dragon Disciple protects him from critical hits.~

// Dragon Wings: Wing Buffet
@40 = ~Wing Buffet~
@41 = ~Wing Buffet

The Black Dragon Disciple beats his wings, knocking down and pushing back the creatures around him. Once used, it recharges in 4 rounds.~
@42 = ~Wing Buffet ready~
